                <profile name="Menaulatoi" id="d159-b6be-960c-3985" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">Up to four Yeomen in a Byzantine war­band may be made a member of the Menaulatoi, the first line to welcome advancing enemy. This costs +5 ducats per model and can be done after the model has been recruited. These models gain +1 DICE to their ranged attack ACTIONS when fight­ing within 4&quot; of another Menaulatoi. This does not apply to GRENADE weapons.</characteristic>
