            <modifier field="info" type="add" value="The Pile of Stuff shows all things your army could ever buy by brute-force unhiding all of its content stuff. Not all of it can be bought at once, and some of it cannot even be stored (such as items stolen with Envious Eyes). Just because something is visible here, does not mean you can put it on your units! This is intended only as a convenience tool.">
