                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">This is the only banner the Red Brigade Warband can buy. As long as the model carrying this banner is not taken Out of Action, the Red Brigade will never retreat from combat. If they lose a Morale test, they will become Shaken instead. If the Standard bearer is taken Out of Action, the Warband takes Morale tests as normal.</characteristic>
